  "rationale": "83 units of Cream Bun 400G at Outlet 05 (East Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-18; doing nothing writes off ₹5692 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹2731. This play uses a bundle with SKU-CHEESE-SLICES-200G at ₹169 for 306 consented customers (Personal care regulars, Everyday staples shoppers, Tea connoisseurs, Sweets occasionals, Household essentials buyers, Premium Tea regulars): expected 30 units, margin ₹402, discount cost ₹620, waste avoided ₹2023 (CI 2 to 86 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs the Cream Bun 400G with Cheese Slices 200G at a bundle price of INR 169.00, which satisfies the 8% bakery margin floor and is preferred over markdowns by policy.",
